      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَمْلَقَهُ</span></b>  <i>He made it smooth and even:</i> [or
<i>smooth and round:</i>] like [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَمْلَجَهُ</span> and] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَمْلَكَهُ</span>.
(TA) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُمْلَقٌ</span> <i>It was made smooth and
round:</i> or <i>smooth like the hand, and,</i> accord. to
some, <i>hard.</i> (TA.)

